evidence = "Gotcha 3685 inventory at 92818149c731: recovered block 1 refused after four ordinal approvals. In the carried af91dcafa5a4 tree the restore case passed after its protected-root fixture repair; all attempt-1 new cases passed (gotcha 3686)."

